    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In HomeNaut, navigate platform challenges with puzzles while spinning the direction of gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784640/extras/c68bf2ac7628128a9549ee1b76dafdc6.poster.avif?t=1727188729\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784640/extras/c68bf2ac7628128a9549ee1b76dafdc6.webm?t=1727188729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784640/extras/c68bf2ac7628128a9549ee1b76dafdc6.mp4?t=1727188729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A single-player adventure where you explore a small Pixel Art world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore more than 50 levels that requires your logic and perception</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Extra challenge with collectibles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784640/extras/2e22746b603d26b7ac3cdd86fc4b69f3.poster.avif?t=1727188729\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784640/extras/2e22746b603d26b7ac3cdd86fc4b69f3.webm?t=1727188729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784640/extras/2e22746b603d26b7ac3cdd86fc4b69f3.mp4?t=1727188729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden among the inner corners of homes, exploring mice called HomeNauts aim to reach the &quot;Moon&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784640/extras/e1c28428019e672d8669c69be54d39a8.poster.avif?t=1727188729\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784640/extras/e1c28428019e672d8669c69be54d39a8.webm?t=1727188729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784640/extras/e1c28428019e672d8669c69be54d39a8.mp4?t=1727188729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
