h the &quot;Moon&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784640/extras/e1c28428019e672d8669c69be54d39a8.poster.avif?t=1727188729\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784640/extras/e1c28428019e672d8669c69be54d39a8.webm?t=1727188729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784640/extras/e1c28428019e672d8669c69be54d39a8.mp4?t=1727188729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
